{"chapter-slug":"rw7-07","paragraph":949,"wording":"[Mayor]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Cetris stood up. Erin sat down. The other [Innkeepers] moved back. The [Mayor], breathing hard, shook his head.","id":"f0526a31-56de-5d13-aa77-86b2697d4173"}
